日志和监控是生产环境应用的重要组成部分，ASP.NET Core 提供了内置的日志框架和健康检查机制。
## 内置日志框架

ASP.NET Core 使用 ILogger 接口进行日志记录：
```csharp
public class MyService
{
    private readonly ILogger<MyService> _logger;

    public MyService(ILogger<MyService> logger)
    {
        _logger = logger;
    }

    public void DoWork()
    {
        _logger.LogInformation("开始处理工作");
        try
        {
            // 处理逻辑
            _logger.LogInformation("工作处理完成");
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            _logger.LogError(ex, "工作处理失败");
            throw;
        }
    }
}
```

## 日志级别

ASP.NET Core 定义了 7 个日志级别：
```csharp
public enum LogLevel
{
    Trace,      // 最详细，开发调试
    Debug,      // 调试信息
    Information,// 一般信息
    Warning,    // 警告
    Error,      // 错误
    Critical,   // 严重错误
    None        // 关闭日志
}
```

**使用建议**：
- Trace/Debug：开发环境详细日志
- Information：生产环境正常操作
- Warning：潜在问题，不影响运行
- Error：异常错误，需要关注
- Critical：严重故障，需要立即处理

## 结构化日志

支持结构化日志参数：
```csharp
_logger.LogInformation("用户 {UserId} 登录成功", userId);
_logger.LogWarning("订单 {OrderId} 超时，等待时间 {WaitTime}ms", orderId, waitTime);
```

结构化日志的好处：
1. 便于日志聚合和分析
2. 支持日志查询和过滤
3. 保留参数类型信息

## 日志作用域

使用日志作用域添加上下文信息：
```csharp
using (_logger.BeginScope(new Dictionary<string, object>
{
    ["RequestId"] = requestId,
    ["UserId"] = userId
}))
{
    _logger.LogInformation("处理请求");
    // 所有日志都会包含 RequestId 和 UserId
}
```

## Serilog 集成

Serilog 是流行的第三方日志框架，提供丰富的接收器（Sink）：
```csharp
// 安装 NuGet 包
// Serilog.AspNetCore
// Serilog.Sinks.Console
// Serilog.Sinks.File
// Serilog.Sinks.Seq

builder.Host.UseSerilog((context, config) =>
{
    config
        .MinimumLevel.Information()
        .MinimumLevel.Override("Microsoft", LogEventLevel.Warning)
        .Enrich.FromLogContext()
        .WriteTo.Console()
        .WriteTo.File("logs/log-.txt", rollingInterval: RollingInterval.Day)
        .WriteTo.Seq("http://localhost:5341");
});
```

## 常用日志接收器

- Console：控制台输出
- File：文件日志
- Seq：结构化日志服务器
- Elasticsearch：日志聚合
- Application Insights：Azure 监控
- Serilog.Sinks.MSSqlServer：数据库日志

## HealthCheck

健康检查用于监控应用状态：
```csharp
// 注册健康检查
builder.Services.AddHealthChecks()
    .AddCheck("self", () => HealthCheckResult.Healthy())
    .AddSqlServer(connectionString)
    .AddRedis(redisConnection);

// 配置端点
app.MapHealthChecks("/health");
app.MapHealthChecks("/health/ready", new HealthCheckOptions
{
    Predicate = check => check.Tags.Contains("ready")
});
app.MapHealthChecks("/health/live", new HealthCheckOptions
{
    Predicate = _ => false
});
```

**自定义健康检查**：
```csharp
public class DatabaseHealthCheck : IHealthCheck
{
    private readonly string _connectionString;

    public DatabaseHealthCheck(string connectionString)
    {
        _connectionString = connectionString;
    }

    public async Task<HealthCheckResult> CheckHealthAsync(
        HealthCheckContext context,
        CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)
    {
        try
        {
            using var connection = new SqlConnection(_connectionString);
            await connection.OpenAsync(cancellationToken);
            return HealthCheckResult.Healthy("数据库连接正常");
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            return HealthCheckResult.Unhealthy("数据库连接失败", ex);
        }
    }
}
```

## 监控集成

**接入 Application Insights 上报遥测数据**：
```csharp
builder.Services.AddApplicationInsightsTelemetry();
```

**Prometheus**：
```csharp
app.UseMetricServer();
app.UseHttpMetrics();
```

**OpenTelemetry**：
```csharp
builder.Services.AddOpenTelemetry()
    .WithTracing(builder => builder
        .AddAspNetCoreInstrumentation()
        .AddHttpClientInstrumentation()
        .AddJaegerExporter());
```

## 取舍与落地
日志的核心取舍是「信息量对性能和成本」：高频路径打 Info 级日志会拖慢性能、撑爆存储，要靠日志级别和采样控制，热点只在 Warning/Error 留痕。结构化日志（Serilog）远优于字符串拼接——参数作为字段能在日志平台按字段检索和聚合，纯文本后期没法查。分布式系统必须用 TraceId 把一次请求的跨服务日志串起来，否则排查无从下手，这正是可观测性三支柱里 Tracing 的价值。验证：制造一个跨服务请求，看日志平台能不能用同一个 TraceId 把各服务的日志串成一条链路；并确认敏感信息（密码、token、身份证）没有被打进日志。

using System;
using System.Collections.Generic;
using System.Threading;
using System.Threading.Tasks;
using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Builder;
using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Diagnostics.HealthChecks;
using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http;
using Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;
using Microsoft.Extensions.Diagnostics.HealthChecks;
using Microsoft.Extensions.Logging;
using Serilog;
using Serilog.Events;

namespace LoggingMonitoringDemo
{
    // 自定义健康检查
    public class MemoryHealthCheck : IHealthCheck
    {
        private readonly ILogger<MemoryHealthCheck> _logger;

        public MemoryHealthCheck(ILogger<MemoryHealthCheck> logger)
        {
            _logger = logger;
        }

        public Task<HealthCheckResult> CheckHealthAsync(
            HealthCheckContext context,
            CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)
        {
            var allocated = GC.GetTotalMemory(forceFullCollection: false);
            var threshold = 1024L * 1024L * 1024L; // 1GB

            _logger.LogDebug("当前内存使用: {Allocated} bytes", allocated);

            var status = allocated < threshold
                ? HealthStatus.Healthy
                : HealthStatus.Degraded;

            var data = new Dictionary<string, object>
            {
                { "allocatedBytes", allocated },
                { "thresholdBytes", threshold }
            };

            return Task.FromResult(new HealthCheckResult(
                status,
                description: $"内存使用: {allocated / 1024 / 1024}MB",
                data: data));
        }
    }

    // 使用日志的服务
    public class OrderService
    {
        private readonly ILogger<OrderService> _logger;

        public OrderService(ILogger<OrderService> logger)
        {
            _logger = logger;
        }

        public async Task ProcessOrderAsync(string orderId)
        {
            using var scope = _logger.BeginScope(new Dictionary<string, object>
            {
                ["OrderId"] = orderId,
                ["Operation"] = "ProcessOrder"
            });

            _logger.LogInformation("开始处理订单 {OrderId}", orderId);

            try
            {
                // 模拟处理
                await Task.Delay(100);

                _logger.LogInformation("订单 {OrderId} 处理完成", orderId);
            }
            catch (Exception ex)
            {
                _logger.LogError(ex, "订单 {OrderId} 处理失败", orderId);
                throw;
            }
        }
    }

    class Program
    {
        static void Main(string[] args)
        {
            // 配置 Serilog
            Log.Logger = new LoggerConfiguration()
                .MinimumLevel.Information()
                .MinimumLevel.Override("Microsoft", LogEventLevel.Warning)
                .Enrich.FromLogContext()
                .WriteTo.Console(
                    outputTemplate: "{Timestamp:HH:mm:ss} [{Level:u3}] {Message:lj}{NewLine}{Exception}")
                .WriteTo.File("logs/log-.txt",
                    rollingInterval: RollingInterval.Day,
                    retainedFileCountLimit: 7)
                .CreateLogger();

            try
            {
                Log.Information("应用启动中...");

                var builder = WebApplication.CreateBuilder(args);

                // 使用 Serilog
                builder.Host.UseSerilog();

                // 注册健康检查
                builder.Services.AddHealthChecks()
                    .AddCheck<MemoryHealthCheck>("memory",
                        failureStatus: HealthStatus.Degraded,
                        tags: new[] { "ready" })
                    .AddCheck("self",
                        () => HealthCheckResult.Healthy("应用运行正常"),
                        tags: new[] { "live" });

                // 注册服务
                builder.Services.AddTransient<OrderService>();

                var app = builder.Build();

                // 配置健康检查端点
                app.MapHealthChecks("/health", new HealthCheckOptions
                {
                    ResponseWriter = async (context, report) =>
                    {
                        context.Response.ContentType = "application/json";
                        var result = new
                        {
                            status = report.Status.ToString(),
                            checks = report.Entries.Select(e => new
                            {
                                name = e.Key,
                                status = e.Value.Status.ToString(),
                                description = e.Value.Description,
                                duration = e.Value.Duration
                            }),
                            totalDuration = report.TotalDuration
                        };
                        await context.Response.WriteAsJsonAsync(result);
                    }
                });

                app.MapHealthChecks("/health/ready", new HealthCheckOptions
                {
                    Predicate = check => check.Tags.Contains("ready")
                });

                app.MapHealthChecks("/health/live", new HealthCheckOptions
                {
                    Predicate = check => check.Tags.Contains("live")
                });

                // 使用日志
                app.MapGet("/", (ILogger<Program> logger) =>
                {
                    logger.LogInformation("收到根路径请求");
                    return "Hello World!";
                });

                app.MapGet("/order/{id}", async (string id, OrderService orderService) =>
                {
                    await orderService.ProcessOrderAsync(id);
                    return Results.Ok($"订单 {id} 已处理");
                });

                app.Run();
            }
            catch (Exception ex)
            {
                Log.Fatal(ex, "应用启动失败");
            }
            finally
            {
                Log.CloseAndFlush();
            }
        }
    }
}
